WEBVTT

00:18.379 --> 00:22.761
The streetlights make a blurry line

00:25.803 --> 00:30.266
I'm running through the same old signs

00:33.648 --> 00:36.470
I'm just a face in a passing crowd

00:39.663 --> 00:44.647
Afraid to speak my thoughts out loud

00:47.889 --> 00:53.113
But then you found me in the noise

00:55.254 --> 01:00.018
You heard a whisper in my voice

01:03.100 --> 01:06.603
You gave me something to believe

01:09.133 --> 01:14.957
A reason I would never leave

01:16.297 --> 01:23.962
If you walked away The sky would lose its blue I

01:24.022 --> 01:31.132
wouldn't know what to do I'd be lonely If you

01:31.432 --> 01:39.700
walked away, my world would fall apart.

01:56.068 --> 02:01.353
They build these walls so high and steep

02:03.375 --> 02:08.540
With promises they never keep

02:11.003 --> 02:14.706
But we have a fortress strong and true

02:17.237 --> 02:27.940
I'm safe as long as I have you. If you walked away,

02:27.960 --> 02:33.781
the sky would lose its blue. I wouldn't know what

02:33.841 --> 02:42.643
to do. I'd be lost in the gray. If you walked away,

02:43.003 --> 02:46.084
my world would fall apart.

02:49.686 --> 02:55.932
I'm holding

02:56.993 --> 02:57.554
on,

03:00.597 --> 03:02.138
I'm holding tight

03:07.642 --> 03:17.787
Don't let me go into the night

03:17.827 --> 03:24.770
If you walked away The sky would lose its blue I

03:25.611 --> 03:30.793
wouldn't know what to do I'd be lost Lost in the

03:30.893 --> 03:40.938
grey If you walked away My world would fall apart

03:43.118 --> 03:48.621
You're the owner of my

03:48.981 --> 03:51.142
own heart

03:55.544 --> 03:58.145
Don't walk away

